## Environment, not code

| Sign | Check | Report |
|---|---|---|
| {{env_sign}} | `{{env_check}}` | `BLOCKED` — {{env_owner}} |

<!-- GEN: e.g. service not listening (lsof), missing env var, stale build/cache, dependency drift. -->

Never stop or restart a stack you did not start, and never change shared configuration to get past an environment problem.

## Time-box

After **{{max_attempts}}** hypotheses or fix attempts without progress, stop and report: reproduction, hypotheses tried and ruled out, current best guess, what evidence is missing. Escalate to {{escalation_role}}.

## Back to the gate

A fix that changes behavior, an API, the architecture, a dependency or a component contract is not a debugging fix: stop and return to {{gate_for_changes}}.

